file-info-size\"></a><a name=\"index-file_002dinfo_002dsize\"></a><table width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"left\"> <code>(</code><code><b><a href=\"https://github.com/gambit/gambit/wiki/Documentation:Procedure%20file%E2%80%90info%E2%80%90size\">file-info-size</a></b></code><i> <var>file-info</var></i><code>)</code></td><td align=\"right\">procedure</td></tr></table>\n15861:<p>Returns the size field of the file-information record\n15862:<var>file-info</var>.\n15866:<table><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td><pre class=\"smallexample\">&gt; <b>(file-info-size (file-info &quot;/dev/tty&quot;))</b>\n15872:<a name=\"Definition_of_file-info-last-access-time\"></a><a name=\"Procedure_file-info-last-access-time\"></a><a name=\"index-file_002dinfo_002dlast_002daccess_002dtime\"></a><table width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"left\"> <code>(</code><code><b><a href=\"https://github.com/gambit/gambit/wiki/Documentation:Procedure%20file%E2%80%90info%E2%80%90last%E2%80%90access%E2%80%90time\">file-info-last-access-time</a></b></code><i> <var>file-info</var></i><code>)</code></td><td align=\"right\">procedure</td></tr></table>\n15874:<p>Returns the last-access-time field of the file-information record\n15875:<var>file-info</var>.\n15879:<table><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td><pre class=\"smallexample\">&gt; <b>(file-info-last-access-time (file-info &quot;/dev/tty&quot;))</b>\n15885:<a name=\"Definition_of_file-info-last-modification-time\"></a><a name=\"Procedure_file-info-last-modification-time\"></a><a name=\"index-file_002dinfo_002dlast_002dmodification_002dtime\"></a><table width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"left\"> <code>(</code><code><b><a href=\"https://github.com/gambit/gambit/wiki/Documentation:Procedure%20file%E2%80%90info%E2%80%90last%E2%80%90modification%E2%80%90time\">file-info-last-modification-time</a></b></code><i> <var>file-info</var></i><code>)</code></td><td align=\"right\">procedure</td></tr></table>\n15887:<p>Returns the last-modification-time field of the file-information record\n15888:<var>file-info</var>.\n15892:<table><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td><pre class=\"smallexample\">&gt; <b>(file-info-last-modification-time (file-info &quot;/dev/tty&quot;))</b>\n15898:<a name=\"Definition_of_file-info-last-change-time\"></a><a name=\"Procedure_file-info-last-change-time\"></a><a name=\"index-file_002dinfo_002dlast_002dchange_002dtime\"></a><table width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"left\"> <code>(</code><code><b><a href=\"https://github.com/gambit/gambit/wiki/Documentation:Procedure%20file%E2%80%90info%E2%80%90last%E2%80%90change%E2%80%90time\">file-info-last-change-time</a></b></code><i> <var>file-info</var></i><code>)</code></td><td align=\"right\">procedure</td></tr></table>\n15900:<p>Returns the last-change-time field of the file-information record\n15901:<var>file-info</var>.\n15905:<table><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td><pre class=\"smallexample\">&gt; <b>(file-info-last-change-time (file-info &quot;/dev/tty&quot;))</b>\n15911:<a name=\"Definition_of_file-info-attributes\"></a><a name=\"Procedure_file-info-attributes\"></a><a name=\"index-file_002dinfo_002dattributes\"></a><table width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"left\"> <code>(</code><code><b><a href=\"https://github.com/gambit/gambit/wiki/Documentation:Procedure%20file%E2%80%90info%E2%80%90attributes\">file-info-attributes</a></b></code><i> <var>file-info</var></i><code>)</code></td><td align=\"right\">procedure</td></tr></table>\n15913:<p>Returns the attributes field of the file-information record\n15914:<var>file-info</var>.\n15918:<table><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td><pre class=\"smallexample\">&gt; <b>(file-info-attributes (file-info &quot;/dev/tty&quot;))</b>\n15924:<a name=\"Definition_of_file-info-creation-time\"></a><a name=\"Procedure_file-info-creation-time\"></a><a name=\"index-file_002dinfo_002dcreation_002dtime\"></a><table width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"left\"> <code>(</code><code><b><a href=\"https://github.com/gambit/gambit/wiki/Documentation:Procedure%20file%E2%80%90info%E2%80%90creation%E2%80%90time\">file-info-creation-time</a></b></code><i> <var>file-info</var></i><code>)</code></td><td align=\"right\">procedure</td></tr></table>\n15926:<p>Returns the creation-time field of the file-information record\n15927:<var>file-info</var>.\n15931:<table><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td><pre class=\"smallexample\">&gt; <b>(file-info-creation-time (file-info &quot;/dev/tty&quot;))</b>\n15938:<a name=\"Definition_of_file-device\"></a><a name=\"Procedure_file-device\"></a><a name=\"index-file_002ddevice\"></a><table width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"left\"> <code>(</code><code><b><a href=\"https://github.com/gambit/gambit/wiki/Documentation:Procedure%20file%E2%80%90device\">file-device</a></b></code><i> <var>path</var></i><code>)</code></td><td align=\"right\">procedure</td></tr></table>\n15951:<p>These procedures combine a call to the <code>file-info</code> procedure and\n15952:a call to a file-information record field accessor.  For instance\n15953:<code>(file-type <var>path</var>)</code> is equivalent to <code>(file-info-type\n15954:(file-info <var>path</var>))</code>.\n15997:<tr><td valign=\"middle\" align=\"left\">[<a href=\"#File-information\" title=\"Previous section in reading order\"> &lt; </a>]</td>\n17204:<a name=\"Definition_of_force-output\"></a><a name=\"Procedure_force-output\"></a><a name=\"index-force_002doutput\"></a><table width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"left\"> <code>(</code><code><b><a href=\"https://github.com/gambit/gambit/wiki/Documentation:Procedure%20force%E2%80%90output\">force-output</a></b></code><i> <span class=\"roman\">[</span><var>port</var> <span class=\"roman\">[</span><var>level</var><span class=\"roman\">]</span><span class=\"roman\">]</span></i><code>)</code></td><td align=\"right\">procedure</td></tr></table>\n17206:<p>The procedure <code>force-output</code> causes the data that was written to\n17225:UNIX this corresponds to a <code>fsync</code> system call.\n17233:system call with operation <code>F_FULLFSYNC</code>.\n17239:&gt; <b>(force-output p)</b>\n18080:<code>create:</code> ( <code>#f</code> | <code>#t</code> | <code>maybe</code> )\n18098:<code>truncate:</code> ( <code>#f</code> | <code>#t</code> )\n18100:<p>This setting controls whether the file will be truncated when it is\n18112:          create: #f)\n18116:(with-output-to-file '(path: &quot;nofile&quot; create: #f) '#&lt;procedure #2&gt;)\n18121:<a name=\"Definition_of_input-port-byte-position\"></a><a name=\"Procedure_input-port-byte-position\"></a><a name=\"index-input_002dport_002dbyte_002dposition\"></a><table width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"left\"> <code>(</code><code><b><a href=\"https://github.com/gambit/gambit/wiki/Documentation:Procedure%20input%E2%80%90port%E2%80%90byte%E2%80%90position\">input-port-byte-position</a></b></code><i> <var>port</var> <span class=\"roman\">[</span><var>position</var> <span class=\"roman\">[</span><var>whence</var><span class=\"roman\">]</span><span class=\"roman\">]</span></i><code>)</code></td><td align=\"right\">procedure</td></tr></table>\n18122:<a name=\"Definition_of_output-port-byte-position\"></a><a name=\"Procedure_output-port-byte-position\"></a><a name=\"index-output_002dport_002dbyte_002dposition\"></a><table width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"left\"> <code>(</code><code><b><a href=\"https://github.com/gambit/gambit/wiki/Documentation:Procedure%20output%E2%80%90port%E2%80%90byte%E2%80%90position\">output-port-byte-position</a></b></code><i> <var>port</var> <span class=\"roman\">[</span><var>position</var> <span class=\"roman\">[</span><var>whence</var><span class=\"roman\">]</span><span class=\"roman\">]</span></i><code>)</code></td><td align=\"right\">procedure</td></tr></table>\n18137:<p>When <code>input-port-byte-position</code> is called to change the byte\n/Users/sto/.local/share/mise/installs/babashka/1.13.225/bb\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
