{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_69","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"set -e\npython3 -c 'from pathlib import Path\nfrom difflib import unified_diff\n\np = Path(\\\"host/gambit/yin/file.ss\\\")\ns = p.read_text().replace(\n    \\\"(path-strip-trailing-directory-separator (path-normalize path))))\\\",\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"(let ((normalized (path-normalize path)))\n      (if (string=? normalized \\\"/\\\")\n          normalized\n          (path-strip-trailing-directory-separator normalized)))))\\\"\\\"\\\")\ns = s.replace(\\\"(define (gambit-yin-read-file path limit)\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\";; Gambit'\\\\''s call-with-file procedures close only on normal return.\n(define (gambit-yin-with-file-port port f)\n  (dynamic-wind (lambda () #f)\n                (lambda () (f port))\n                (lambda () (close-port port))))\n\n(define (gambit-yin-read-file path limit)\\\"\\\"\\\")\ns = s.replace(\\\"(call-with-input-file path\\\", \\\"(gambit-yin-with-file-port (open-input-file path)\\\")\ns = s.replace(\\\"\\\"\\\"(call-with-output-file\n          (list path: path create: #t\n                permissions: (if (jolt-truthy? private?) #o600 #o666))\\\"\\\"\\\",\n              \\\"\\\"\\\"(gambit-yin-with-file-port\n          (open-output-file\n            (list path: path create: #t buffering: #f\n                  permissions: (if (jolt-truthy? private?) #o600 #o666)))\\\"\\\"\\\")\np.write_text(s)\n\nroot = Path(\\\"build/p2/datomworld\\\")\nchanges = {}\n\nlauncher = root / \\\"src/dev/yin_repl_launch.clj\\\"\nbefore = launcher.read_text()\nafter = before.replace(\n    \\\"Local --index-store mem session; no :yang/python frontend or WebSocket serving.\\\",\n    \\\"--index-store mem, dht: (memory), file:<dir> and dht:<dir> (durable). No :yang/python frontend or WebSocket serving.\\\")\nassert after \"'!= before\nchanges[launcher.relative_to(root)] = (before, after)\n\ndoc = root / \"src/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md\"\nbefore = doc.read_text()\nafter = before.replace(\"`--index-store mem`, etc.\", \"`--index-store mem`, `file:<dir>`, `dht:` and `dht:<dir>`\")\nstart = after.index(\"- **Gambit boundary (\")\nend = after.index(\"'\"\\\\n---\\\", start)\nafter = after[:start] + \\\"\\\"\\\"- **Gambit stores (\"'`jolt-gambit`):**\n  - `mem` and `dht:` are memory-backed. `file:<dir>` and `dht:<dir>` use the durable directory store and resume from `state.edn`.\n  - Store changes preserve the Gambit host modules (`jolt.ffi` and `dao.jing.mem`; re-require them in the rebuilt session).\n  - The C4 refusal still applies to user-declared blocking FFI. WebSocket serving is unavailable on this host.\n\n\"\"\" + after[end:]\nchanges[doc.relative_to(root)] = (before, after)\npatch = []\nfor relative, (before, after) in changes.items():\n    patch.append(f\"diff --git a/{relative} b/{relative}'\"\\\\n\\\")\n    patch.extend(unified_diff(before.splitlines(True), after.splitlines(True),\n                              f\\\"a/{relative}\\\", f\\\"b/{relative}\\\"))\n    (root / relative).write_text(after)\nPath(\\\"host/gambit/yin/datomworld-launcher.patch\\\").write_text(\\\"\\\".join(patch))\n'\nexport PATH=\\\"/Users/sto/.local/share/mise/installs/babashka/1.13.225:\"'$PATH\"\nexport TMPDIR=\"$PWD/build/p2/tmp\"\ncd build/p2/datomworld\nbb yin-repl --backend jolt-gambit --help >../bb-help.out\nsh ../../../host/gambit/ffi/watchdog.sh 2400 bb yin-repl --backend jolt-gambit --dir ../bb-file-state --index-store file:../bb-file-store >../bb-file-first.out 2>../bb-file-first.err <<'\"'EOF'\n(def bb-file-witness 7331)\nbb-file-witness\n(quit)\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
