ractive REPL use --backend jvm, node, jolt-chez, or jolt-gambit\n  jolt-chez    Pinned Jolt shell with the native Python frontend.\n  jolt-gambit  --index-store mem, dht: (memory), file:<dir> and dht:<dir> (durable). No :yang/python frontend or WebSocket serving.\n               Blocking FFI refuses inline: blocking ffi is unsupported on the gambit target.\n               First launch builds the boot and bridge (~16 min to yin> on macOS). Cache hits reach native Gambit in ~0.6 s.\n               The pinned loader interprets Yin namespaces from source (~11 min to yin> with caches).\n\nUse -- --help after the backend to pass --help to the selected program.\n  ok     (seq (eduction (map inc) [1 2])) => (2 3)\n  ok     (try (zero? \"a\") (catch ClassCastException e (ex-message e))) => \"class java.lang.String cannot be cast to class java.lang.Number\"\n  ok     (with-open [r (reify java.io.Closeable (close [_] nil))] 1) => 1\n  ok     (with-out-str (print \"hi\")) => \"hi\"\n  ok     (try (throw (ex-info \"x\" {})) (catch Exception e :caught)) => :caught\n  ok     (try (re-pattern \"\\\\p{L}\") (catch Exception e (str (class e)))) => \"class java.util.regex.PatternSyntaxException\"\n  ok     [(parse-long \"42\") (parse-long \"x\") (parse-long \"-7\")] => [42 nil -7]\n  ok     (try (Long/parseLong \"zz\") (catch NumberFormatException e (etotal 280\n-rw-r--r--@  1 sto  staff   1286 Nov 26 18:32 bb-file-first.err\n-rw-r--r--@  1 sto  staff  36856 Nov 26 18:32 bb-file-first.out\n-rw-r--r--@  1 sto  staff    983 Nov 26 18:32 bb-help.out\n-rw-r--r--@  1 sto  staff      0 Nov 26 18:24 boot.log\n-rw-r--r--@  1 sto  staff     94 Nov 26 18:29 boot.path\ndrwxr-xr-x@  5 sto  staff    160 Nov 26 18:30 component\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 57 sto  staff   1824 Nov 26 18:24 datomworld\n-rw-r--r--@  1 sto  staff   1236 Nov 26 18:30 file-component.ss\n-rw-r--r--@  1 sto  staff   2783 Nov 26 18:32 first.err\n-rw-r--r--@  1 sto  staff  35840 Nov 26 18:30 first.out\n-rw-r--r--@  1 sto  staff  41527 Nov 2